==German==

===Etymology===
Ca. 1600, from {{bor|de|fr|flanc}}, from {{der|de|fro|flanc}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*hlankō}}. Doublet of now obsolete {{doublet|de|Lanke|notext=1}}, which likely influenced the form and gender of the borrowing; analogy with {{m|de|Seite}} may also have contributed.

